1
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:07,160
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,840
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:16,160
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,440
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,360
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,800
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,360
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,840
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,640
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,600
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,480
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,680
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,680
=Episode 14=

17
00:00:52,079 --> 00:00:54,600
(Why is there no word
from the Cold Palace?)

18
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,880
(Has something gone wrong?)

19
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,359
Your Majesty, the Emperor is here.

20
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:02,399
No need to announce me.

21
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,719
What is he doing?

22
00:01:08,239 --> 00:01:10,280
Have you forgotten basic courtesy?

23
00:01:16,359 --> 00:01:17,719
Stop waiting, Mother.

24
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:21,159
The men you sent aren't coming back.

25
00:01:21,159 --> 00:01:22,599
So you know?

26
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:25,120
Before I could ask a thing,

27
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:27,280
that man bit his tongue and died.

28
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:30,680
Such unwavering loyalty.

29
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:38,079
I only meant to teach Lady Lu a lesson.

30
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:40,519
She's been far too brazen lately,

31
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:42,400
using her charms on the Emperor.

32
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:45,879
Why make such a fuss, Your Majesty?

33
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,040
(Ning)

34
00:01:50,879 --> 00:01:53,359
I'll discipline my own woman.

35
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:56,560
Please don't overstep again, Mother,

36
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,640
or you'll truly disappoint me.

37
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:15,360
The Third Prince was right.

38
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:19,000
I truly chose the wrong man.

39
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:21,120
Perhaps you've forgotten, Your Majesty.

40
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,240
The Third Prince and the chancellor
committed treason.

41
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,039
They are still on the run.

42
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:27,120
You must not mention him again.

43
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,560
I know where he is.

44
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:33,560
Better an obedient dog

45
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:37,159
than a wolf that turns on its master.

46
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:44,400
Now this is a proper night out!

47
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:47,120
Why so generous all of a sudden,

48
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,159
taking me out of the palace?

49
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,919
You were attacked yesterday.

50
00:02:51,759 --> 00:02:53,800
I couldn't leave you there alone.

51
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,599
I have someone to meet today.

52
00:02:57,719 --> 00:02:59,080
I decided to bring you along.

53
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,240
Like it?

54
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,199
Yes.

55
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,039
Your...

56
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,879
My dear, which one looks best?

57
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,400
All of them.

58
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,159
Every hairpin here suits you.

59
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,280
Such a devoted husband!

60
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,680
Standing together,

61
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:28,800
you look like a couple
straight out of a painting.

62
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,400
Wrap up every hairpin here.

63
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,479
Certainly, sir!

64
00:03:34,919 --> 00:03:36,039
Are you mad?

65
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:37,199
I only have one head.

66
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:38,319
How could I wear them all?

67
00:03:38,919 --> 00:03:40,000
You like them, don't you?

68
00:03:40,159 --> 00:03:41,520
What a lucky woman!

69
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:43,039
Your husband dotes on you.

70
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,840
You should accept his kindness.

71
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:47,199
I recall someone saying

72
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,240
he never carries money.

73
00:03:55,759 --> 00:03:58,560
I won't make the same mistake twice.

74
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:00,879
Here.

75
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:02,120
Certainly!

76
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,719
I'll wrap them all up.

77
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:16,399
(Is this what shopping with
a domineering CEO feels like?)

78
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,680
The palace has so many treasures.

79
00:04:20,199 --> 00:04:21,839
Yet none made you this happy.

80
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:23,639
That's different.

81
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,879
In the palace,

82
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:26,959
everything is about rank and rules.

83
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,920
Even the flowers bloom on command.

84
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:31,439
If the late Emperor hadn't arranged it,

85
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,240
you wouldn't have
married into the palace.

86
00:04:33,839 --> 00:04:34,879
What would you have done?

87
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:36,839
Me?

88
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,720
Yes.

89
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:41,319
I'd open an entire shopping street.

90
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:44,160
Every shop would carry my Lu brand.

91
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,800
Quite ambitious.

92
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,199
But

93
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:52,040
I believe you can do it.

94
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:54,639
You...

95
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,399
You don't think it's a pipe dream?

96
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:03,160
Then when will you let me leave?

97
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:07,079
In your next life.

98
00:05:07,319 --> 00:05:08,199
Come.

99
00:05:08,199 --> 00:05:09,399
There's someone I want you to meet.

100
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,040
I knew it.

101
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:13,319
Hmph.

102
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,439
Greetings, Your Majesty.

103
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,279
Greetings, Your Majesty.

104
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:25,879
No need for formalities. Please rise.

105
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:33,520
(Lu Dingyuan)

106
00:05:38,759 --> 00:05:39,560
You...

107
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,439
You're...

108
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,480
Father?

109
00:05:46,279 --> 00:05:47,759
Have I changed so much

110
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:50,439
that you don't recognize me?

111
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:51,959
Father!

112
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,759
You're alive?

113
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:55,199
You two...

114
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,360
Yunluo.

115
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:03,079
Yunluo.

116
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:07,000
I should never have left you
alone in the palace,

117
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,519
with no one to turn to.

118
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,560
(Parents never stop worrying.)

119
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,439
(If she were still here)

120
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,800
(and knew the truth,)

121
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:16,439
(how happy she'd be.)

122
00:06:22,319 --> 00:06:23,120
Father,

123
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:24,839
don't worry.

124
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,879
I'm doing very well now.

125
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,079
Good.

126
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,199
That's good.

127
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,279
Your Majesty,

128
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:43,879
I've been undercover at the border
for over a year.

129
00:06:43,959 --> 00:06:45,560
I now have

130
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:47,319
proof of Bai Zhenhai's treason.

131
00:06:47,879 --> 00:06:49,560
The Third Prince colluded with Xiqing.

132
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,360
Even

133
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:54,240
the Empress Dowager secretly aids them.

134
00:06:54,639 --> 00:06:55,959
That matches what I found.

135
00:06:57,079 --> 00:06:58,519
Our priority now

136
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:01,920
is to make Bai Zhenhai give up command.

137
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:06,160
(What a huge game they're playing!)

138
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,920
(Experience really does count.)

139
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:12,600
(No wonder he raised Ji Wujue
to be such a fox.)

140
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:16,600
Yunluo.

141
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:16,959
Yes?

142
00:07:16,959 --> 00:07:18,639
You've become so composed.

143
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:21,199
Have you been bullied in the palace?

144
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,160
Wait.

145
00:07:24,279 --> 00:07:26,160
I've never mistreated her.

146
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:30,759
(Even emperors fear fathers-in-law.)

147
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:33,279
Don't worry, Father.

148
00:07:34,079 --> 00:07:35,560
His Majesty treats me very well.

149
00:07:35,839 --> 00:07:36,519
Mm.

150
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:38,519
He's just a little stingy with money.

151
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:42,519
Once the Lu family's name is cleared,

152
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:44,680
The Lu family's entire fortune is yours.

153
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,439
I heard from His Majesty

154
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:49,839
you found wheat yielding 10 shi per mu.

155
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:53,720
What a great service to the people!

156
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,399
Enough praise, Father.

157
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:56,800
Keep it up and it'll go to my head!

158
00:07:57,759 --> 00:07:59,319
You deserve every word.

159
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,839
You're Lu Dingyuan's daughter.

160
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:03,079
Naturally, you're the best.

161
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,680
Once this is settled,

162
00:08:04,879 --> 00:08:08,759
I'll record it all in our family annals.

163
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,120
Mm.

164
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:11,560
Father,

165
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,560
do you really have to leave again?

166
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:18,079
Bai Zhenhai commands
100,000 border troops.

167
00:08:18,079 --> 00:08:19,480
Till we regain the Tiger Military Tally,

168
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,480
the danger will remain.

169
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:23,319
You've worked hard, Chancellor Lu.

170
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:25,600
A man's word is his bond.

171
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:29,480
I promised the late Emperor I'd aid you.

172
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,560
I shall do all I can.

173
00:08:31,839 --> 00:08:33,240
As for the Empress Dowager...

174
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,240
The Empress Dowager...

175
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:41,360
Now that we're openly at odds,

176
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,480
let's see

177
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,879
what else she can stir up.

178
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,039
Mm.

179
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,120
Anything else?

180
00:08:58,039 --> 00:08:59,039
If not,

181
00:08:59,039 --> 00:09:00,240
I'd like a moment with my father.

182
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,559
Hey!

183
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:03,200
Yunluo,

184
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,120
mind how you speak to His Majesty!

185
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:05,919
It's fine.

186
00:09:06,519 --> 00:09:07,320
I don't mind.

187
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:09,639
I'm used to it.

188
00:09:12,879 --> 00:09:13,679
Your...

189
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,799
Just don't take too long.

190
00:09:19,519 --> 00:09:20,679
Cold tea upsets the stomach.

191
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,159
All right.

192
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:28,440
Yunluo.

193
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:28,879
Yes?

194
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,840
His Majesty lets you speak so freely.

195
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:36,039
He must care deeply about you.

196
00:09:36,879 --> 00:09:39,679
He does treat me well.

197
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,080
Such a pity.

198
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:45,000
A pity? Why?

199
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,320
Nothing.

200
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:50,919
Father,

201
00:09:51,679 --> 00:09:53,519
the night before your arrest,

202
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:56,000
did you send me a letter
through Prince Chen?

203
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,480
I did.

204
00:09:59,279 --> 00:10:00,840
I asked you to let go of your hatred

205
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,360
and live a peaceful life.

206
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,519
But

207
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,879
the letter I received said...

208
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:13,840
(Escape the palace now.
Go to Xiqing.)

209
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,240
Wait.

210
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,120
The letter was swapped.

211
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,559
Could Prince Chen have...

212
00:10:19,639 --> 00:10:20,679
Impossible.

213
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:24,279
Even if the whole world rebelled,

214
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:26,519
Prince Chen would never betray Donglan.

215
00:10:27,399 --> 00:10:28,879
You trust him that much?

216
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:30,600
He cares only for the people's welfare,

217
00:10:31,159 --> 00:10:32,360
not power.

218
00:10:33,159 --> 00:10:36,080
Tell him to investigate his close
attendants.

219
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,559
His Majesty

220
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:40,000
must not learn of this.

221
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:46,919
I understand, Father.

222
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:49,120
They're trying to drive us apart.

223
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,919
So we can't start doubting each other.

224
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:54,679
You're clever, Yunluo.

225
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:56,919
It's time.

226
00:10:57,799 --> 00:10:59,320
I must go.

227
00:10:59,399 --> 00:11:01,840
When the border fighting is over,

228
00:11:02,559 --> 00:11:05,600
smoke will rise from our hearths again.

229
00:11:06,639 --> 00:11:08,679
Have the victory wine ready

230
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:09,960
and wait for me.

231
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,279
I will.

232
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,120
(Cold Palace)

233
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,960
Farewell, Your Majesty.

234
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,799
Thank you for today.

235
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,799
Can't you at least ask me to stay?

236
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:25,919
What?

237
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:29,879
Hopeless.

238
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:33,960
My lady.

239
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,360
Yes?

240
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,919
His Majesty seems upset.

241
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:36,879
Ignore him.

242
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:37,840
He's impossible.

243
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,320
Oh, right.

244
00:11:40,559 --> 00:11:41,799
When's the Empress Dowager's banquet?

245
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:44,679
In three days, in the Imperial Garden.

246
00:11:44,879 --> 00:11:46,279
Good.

247
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:49,240
Perfect. I can see Prince Chen there.

248
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,159
Wait.

249
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,440
Why hasn't anyone told me?

250
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,320
My invitation?

251
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:56,399
Well...

252
00:11:56,399 --> 00:11:56,960
Oh!

253
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,720
Consort Lan, what brings you here?

254
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:03,000
It's always

255
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,120
lively around here.

256
00:12:04,879 --> 00:12:06,279
What brings you here so late?

257
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,840
I came earlier,

258
00:12:07,919 --> 00:12:09,960
but you were out with His Majesty.

259
00:12:11,559 --> 00:12:12,919
Is it urgent?

260
00:12:14,879 --> 00:12:16,559
It's fine. We're among friends.

261
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:20,960
Have you offended the Empress Dowager?

262
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,600
You heard about that too?

263
00:12:25,679 --> 00:12:27,519
I'm handling her birthday banquet

264
00:12:27,519 --> 00:12:29,240
and the guest list as well.

265
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:31,200
Ningxin Palace sent word today

266
00:12:31,279 --> 00:12:32,879
to remove your name.

267
00:12:33,559 --> 00:12:34,360
What?

268
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:40,080
She tried to win me over a few days ago.

269
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:40,919
I refused.

270
00:12:41,879 --> 00:12:43,440
Now that you've offended her,

271
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,200
you need to be very careful.

272
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:46,919
I will.

273
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,000
Sister,

274
00:12:49,519 --> 00:12:51,039
I need to see someone at the banquet.

275
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,039
Can you help?

276
00:12:53,279 --> 00:12:55,759
If you really want to attend,

277
00:12:56,519 --> 00:12:57,600
perhaps...

278
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:36,040
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

279
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:40,720
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

280
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:45,040
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

281
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:49,480
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

282
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:53,680
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

283
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:58,080
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

284
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:01,880
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

285
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:07,040
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

286
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:10,840
♪No finery to rival spring♪

287
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:15,320
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

288
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:19,440
♪Where is beauty found?♪

289
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:24,160
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

290
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:26,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

291
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:28,360
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

292
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:30,800
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

293
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:32,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

294
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

295
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,360
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

296
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:39,840
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

297
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:44,200
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
